  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1905.13 Changes to the Water Management Plan as a Result of a Waiver",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1905.13 Changes to the Water Management Plan as a Result of a Waiver. If a waiver under Env-Wq 1907 is granted, the department shall amend the water management plan to reflect any changes approved in the decision granting the waiver.\n\nSource. #12695, eff 12-22-18",
